     "head": "Three one-liners to memorize",
     "say": "Three one liners. A power of two has one set bit, so n and n minus one is zero. Lowbit: n and minus n keeps only the lowest set bit, because minus n flips every bit above it. Twelve gives four. Popcount counts set bits: twelve has two.",
